OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRemaining
OL,6,Fcloudy for the evening and into the
OL,7,Fnight, with patches of rain and
OL,8,Fdrizzle persisting, most frequent in
OL,9,Fthe north. A much milder night than
OL,10,FSaturday night.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FA mild start but dull start to
OL,13,Fthe week. Remaining overcast with
OL,14,Fdrizzly showers and hill fog. Breezy,
OL,15,Fparticularly in the northwest.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
