OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FCloud
OL,6,Fand patchy rain on Tuesday, then sunny
OL,7,Fspells and a fresher feel from
OL,8,FWednesday though breezy with a few
OL,9,Fshowers possible. Turning colder by
OL,10,Fnight.
